{"id": "55aa97df-c0b3-40f3-b7a1-e9999ebf7ed0", "slug": "audio-capture-interface", "title": "Audio Capture Interface", "description": "Audio Capture Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Audio Capture Interface\"\ndescription: \"Audio Capture Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FA3E3E\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#F55D2C\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#303033\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#303033\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"3px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Audio Capture Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 9; favorites: 9; remixes: 3.\nTags: button, animated, action, effect, cta.\n## Overview\nAudio Capture Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSession Active Capturing spatial audio. 02:34 Active Voice Session...\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Session Active.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FA3E3E, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #F55D2C, background #FFFFFF, surface #303033, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Audio Capture Interface</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            bg: '#0a0a0c',\n                            surface: '#18181a',\n                            inner: '#1e1e21',\n                            red: '#fa3e3e',\n                            orange: '#f55d2c',\n                            muted: '#6b6b70'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Ambient Background Texture */\n        .bg-texture {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                -45deg,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 0,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 1px,\n                transparent 1px,\n                transparent 8px\n            );\n        }\n\n        /* Waveform Masking */\n        .mask-waveform {\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 40%, black 100%);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 40%, black 100%);\n        }\n\n        /* GSAP Text Reveal Setup */\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-word-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n        }\n\n        /* L-Bracket styling */\n        .l-bracket {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n            border-style: solid;\n        }\n        .bracket-tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px; }\n        .bracket-tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 1px 1px 0 0; }\n        .bracket-bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 0 0 1px 1px; }\n        .bracket-br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0; }\n\n        /* Custom Scrollbar for hidden overflows */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 0px; background: transparent; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-bg text-white min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden font-sans antialiased selection:bg-brand-red/30\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL-style Ambient Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 opacity-40 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Diagonal Texture Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-texture pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-12\">\n        <!-- Main Grid Container -->\n        <div class=\"w-full h-full max-w-6xl relative border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- Grid Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/3 w-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-1/3 w-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-1/4 h-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 bottom-1/4 h-[1px] bg-white/5\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Central Focus Frame -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 m-auto w-full max-w-md h-[500px] border border-white/5 hidden sm:block\">\n                <div class=\"l-bracket bracket-tl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"l-bracket bracket-tr\"></div>\n                <div class=\"l-bracket bracket-bl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"l-bracket bracket-br\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-20 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6\">\n\n        <!-- Masked Reveal Title -->\n        <div class=\"mb-12 text-center relative\">\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-normal tracking-widest uppercase text-white/60 mb-2\">\n                Session Active\n            </h1>\n            <p id=\"reveal-subtitle\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-white\">\n                Capturing spatial audio.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Central UI Component (Reference Match) -->\n        <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-[3.5rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm transform transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n\n            <!-- Outer Bezel Container -->\n            <div class=\"w-[300px] h-[300px] sm:w-[340px] sm:h-[340px] rounded-[3.5rem] bg-[#1a1a1c] p-2 sm:p-[10px] relative shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Screen -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#2a2a2e] to-[#121213] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-[inset_0_2px_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] border border-black/50\">\n\n                    <!-- Ambient Glow behind UI -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_0%,rgba(255,255,255,0.08)_0%,transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Top Section: Waveform -->\n                    <div class=\"h-[45%] w-full pt-10 sm:pt-12 px-6 flex items-center relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- History Waveform (Left) -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[2px] h-14 w-[55%] mask-waveform justify-end pr-2\" id=\"waveform-container\">\n                            <!-- JS injected bars -->\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Playhead -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[38px] bg-brand-orange rounded-full relative z-20 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(245,93,44,0.6)]\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Future Track (Right) -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 ml-3 h-[1px] border-b border-dotted border-white/20\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Middle Section: Time & Info -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center px-8 gap-4 py-2 relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Recording Dot -->\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-red absolute animate-ping opacity-75\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-red relative shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(250,62,62,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Timer -->\n                        <div class=\"text-[2.75rem] font-light tracking-tighter leading-none text-white tabular-nums\">\n                            02:34\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Status Text -->\n                        <div class=\"text-[0.55rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted uppercase leading-relaxed font-normal ml-1\">\n                            Active Voice<br>Session...\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Section: Controls -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-between px-8 pb-6 relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Settings Button -->\n                        <button class=\"w-12 h-12 sm:w-[52px] sm:h-[52px] rounded-full bg-[#262628] flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#303033] border border-white/5 shadow-lg group\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-square-2-linear\" class=\"text-[22px] text-white/60 group-hover:text-white transition-colors stroke-[1.5]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- Pause Button (Primary) -->\n                        <button class=\"w-[68px] h-[68px] sm:w-[76px] sm:h-[76px] rounded-full bg-brand-red flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(250,62,62,0.4)] relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 scale-0 group-active:scale-100 transition-transform duration-200 rounded-full origin-center\"></div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" class=\"text-[28px] text-white relative z-10 stroke-[1.5]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- Stop Button -->\n                        <button class=\"w-12 h-12 sm:w-[52px] sm:h-[52px] rounded-full bg-[#262628] flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#303033] border border-white/5 shadow-lg group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-white/60 group-hover:bg-white transition-colors rounded-[3px]\"></div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            /* --- 1. Waveform Generation & Animation --- */\n            const waveformContainer = document.getElementById('waveform-container');\n            const barCount = 35;\n            const bars = [];\n\n            // Generate bars\n            for (let i = 0; i < barCount; i++) {\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                // Calculate base height (taller in middle, shorter on ends for visual interest)\n                const normalized = i / barCount;\n                const baseHeight = 10 + Math.sin(normalized * Math.PI) * 20 + Math.random() * 15;\n\n                bar.className = 'w-[2px] bg-white/80 rounded-full transition-all duration-75 origin-bottom';\n                bar.style.height = `${baseHeight}px`;\n                // Opacity fades out towards the left edge via CSS mask, but we can add subtle inline opacity variation too\n                bar.style.opacity = 0.5 + (i/barCount) * 0.5;\n\n                waveformContainer.appendChild(bar);\n                bars.push({ el: bar, base: baseHeight });\n            }\n\n            // Animate waveform to simulate active audio\n            setInterval(() => {\n                bars.forEach(barObj => {\n                    // Only animate the rightmost bars actively, left ones settle\n                    const isRecent = bars.indexOf(barObj) > barCount - 15;\n                    if (isRecent && Math.random() > 0.4) {\n                        const jitter = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n                        const newHeight = Math.max(4, Math.min(38, barObj.base + jitter));\n                        barObj.el.style.height = `${newHeight}px`;\n                    } else if (!isRecent) {\n                         // Slowly return older bars to base\n                         const currentHeight = parseFloat(barObj.el.style.height);\n                         barObj.el.style.height = `${currentHeight + (barObj.base - currentHeight) * 0.1}px`;\n                    }\n                });\n            }, 100);\n\n\n            /* --- 2. GSAP Masked Word Reveal --- */\n            const wrapWords = (element) => {\n                const words = element.innerText.split(' ');\n                element.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const outer = document.createElement('span');\n                    outer.className = 'reveal-word';\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'reveal-word-inner';\n                    inner.innerText = word + '\\u00A0'; // Add non-breaking space\n                    outer.appendChild(inner);\n                    element.appendChild(outer);\n                });\n            };\n\n            const title = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            const subtitle = document.getElementById('reveal-subtitle');\n\n            wrapWords(title);\n            wrapWords(subtitle);\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.2 });\n\n            tl.to('#reveal-title .reveal-word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                stagger: 0.05\n            })\n            .to('#reveal-subtitle .reveal-word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                stagger: 0.08\n            }, \"-=0.6\")\n            .fromTo('.shadow-2xl', {\n                y: 40,\n                opacity: 0\n            }, {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: 'expo.out'\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n\n\n            /* --- 3. WebGL-style Ambient Canvas Animation --- */\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let particles = [];\n\n            function resize() {\n                width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            class Particle {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.size = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n                    this.speedX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    this.speedY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    this.alpha = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.speedX;\n                    this.y += this.speedY;\n\n                    // Wrap around\n                    if (this.x < 0) this.x = width;\n                    if (this.x > width) this.x = 0;\n                    if (this.y < 0) this.y = height;\n                    if (this.y > height) this.y = 0;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${this.alpha})`;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) {\n                particles.push(new Particle());\n            }\n\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                // Draw connecting lines if close\n                for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                    particles[i].update();\n                    particles[i].draw();\n\n                    for (let j = i; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                        const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (dist < 100) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.05 * (1 - dist/100)})`;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                            ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n            }\n            animateCanvas();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "audio-capture-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/audio-capture-interface.jpg", "source_name": "audio-capture-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 75, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:43:20.128785+00:00"}